# Docstrings of constants and functions declared separately from their definition

> Module Doc_topdefs

```catala-metadata
## Documented on the signature.
declaration f content integer
  depends on
    ## Documented on the signature.
    x content integer,
    y content integer
```

```catala
## Ignored: outside of metadata blocks.
declaration f content integer
  depends on x content integer, y content integer
  equals x + y
```

```catala-metadata
## Defined along with its declaration.
declaration g content integer equals 1
```

```catala-metadata
## Signature and definition both in metadata blocks.
declaration h content integer
```

```catala-metadata
declaration h content integer equals 2
```

